			"notes": "An issue that in retrospect seems obvious is that in the previous builds of Vortex the modIDs are only instantiated into the hashmaps when they are incremented in usage. from 0 -> 1; therefore, mods that are never used (the primary reason for this mod in the first place) go unrecognized.\n\nTo resolve this issue we've added the /vx unused command.\n\n    Added /vx unused : Lists mods with not tracked interactions.\n    Updated the /vx help command."
